      "t": {
        "zh": "与 ⊥ 相反，「真」永远成立。表上是它的声明：一条引入规则，没有前提，什么都不要。",
        "en": "The opposite of ⊥: True always holds. The table holds its declaration: one intro rule with no premises, needing nothing."
