  "brief": {
    "zh": "需求：「真」什么都不要：不管手里有什么，甚至什么都没有，都能引入。按照这份声明，在表中填出每条条例的目标是否可推导。",
    "en": "Requirement: True needs nothing: it may be introduced whatever is at hand, even with nothing at all. Following this declaration, fill in whether each case’s goal is derivable."
  },
